+ /* $Id: tei.c,v 1.8 1997/04/07 22:59:08 keil Exp $
+ 
+  * Author       Karsten Keil (keil@temic-ech.spacenet.de)
+  *              based on the teles driver from Jan den Ouden
+  *
+  * Thanks to    Jan den Ouden
+  *              Fritz Elfert
+  *
+  * $Log: tei.c,v $
+  * Revision 1.8  1997/04/07 22:59:08  keil
